## System Name

**Role Readiness Engine**

## System Purpose

This system answers:

> “How close is this learner to being ready for a Data Engineer / AI Engineer / MLOps Engineer role?”

## What It Maps

It maps each role to required skills.

## Example Role Readiness Output

Example:

```text
Data Engineer readiness:
- Python scripting: 82%
- SQL transformations: 77%
- orchestration: 45%
- cloud storage: 52%
- data modeling: 70%
- testing/quality: 63%
- streaming: 25%
```

## Recommended Action Output

Then it recommends:

```text
