# SYSTEM 4: PROJECT QUALITY CONTROL SYSTEM

## System Name

**Project Quality Control System**

## System Purpose

Before a project becomes visible, it should pass a strict quality pipeline.

## Quality Pipeline

```text
Project drafted
→ authoring audit
→ pedagogy audit
→ validation audit
→ hiring-signal score
→ portfolio artifact score
→ cloud safety audit
→ H3 copy-safety scan
→ red-team review
→ manual publish checklist
→ visible
```

## Project Quality Score

Each project gets a quality score:

```text
Project Quality Score: 91/100
Hiring Signal: 18/20
Validation Strength: 13/15
Portfolio Artifact: 15/15
Pedagogy: 14/15
Cloud Safety: 10/10
```

## Visibility Rule

Only projects above a threshold should go live.

## Why This Matters

This prevents Atlas from becoming shallow AI-generated content.

