# SYSTEM 7: CLOUD LAB SAFETY SYSTEM

## System Name

**Cloud Lab Safety System**

## System Purpose

Before AWS/Azure/GCP/Snowflake/Databricks integrations, Atlas needs a Cloud Lab Safety System.

## Required Cloud Project Safety Components

Every cloud project should have:

```text
Sandbox Mode
BYO Cloud Mode
Cost warning
Least-privilege policy
Cleanup script
Resource tags
Time limit
Credential safety check
Teardown checklist
```

## Example Cloud Safety Pattern

For example:

```text
AWS project:
- Sandbox Mode: DuckDB + local S3-like folders
- BYO Mode: real S3 + Glue + Athena
- Cost warning: expected <$2 if cleanup completed
- Cleanup: delete bucket, crawler, database, Athena results
```

## Why This Matters

This system prevents learners from accidentally spending money or exposing credentials.

